cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Mars Rover Simulation and Evaluation Framework"
message: "If you use this repository in academic work, please cite the associated research publication and this repository."
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: Jamil
    given-names: Hannan

abstract: >
  ROS 2 and Ignition Gazebo simulation framework for evaluating
  a six-wheeled rover in a Mars-inspired, physically interactive
  environment with stereo vision, inertial sensing, and 3D LiDAR.

keywords:
  - Mars rover
  - planetary robotics
  - space robotics
  - ROS 2
  - Gazebo
  - mobile sensing
  - LiDAR
  - stereo vision
  - IMU
  - simulation

